{
  "title": "MapObjectDescriptor",
  "description": "A format-neutral view of one map object, as handed to a import('./MapObjectSpawner').MapObjectFactory. The descriptor is what game code writes against: it resolves the two things that differ between authoring formats - stable identity and the dispatch key - and pairs the object with the layer it came from. The parsed object itself stays reachable through object, and the untouched source record through TileMapObject.source.",
